solution:
We put the time the train arrives on the $y$-axis and the time  John arrives on the $x$-axis, and shade in the region where John arrives while the train is there.

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(60,0));
draw((0,0)--(0,60)--(60,60)--(60,0));
label("2:00", (0,0), SW);
label("3:00", (60,0), S);
