\[\overrightarrow{BQ}  = \text{The projection of $\overrightarrow{BA}$ onto } \begin{pmatrix} 3 \\-4 \end{pmatrix}.\]Of course, since $\overrightarrow{PA}$ is equal to $\overrightarrow{BQ}$, we see that
